大家能够接受的东西。到了那个时候，门派声望这东西应该就很有用武之地了。[2;37;0m","time":1237778040,"fid":"46","title":"Re:东厂task、谜题讨论帖（3月22日更新）","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(picewolf)[2;37;0m","tid":"5372","authorid":"picewolf",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=53639&ptid=5372到时候正派邪派可以分开，邪派的玩家可以去慕容博的环施水阁领悟功夫。[2;37;0m","time":1237778640,"fid":"46","title":"Re:东厂task、谜题讨论帖（3月22日更新）","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(picewolf)[2;37;0m","tid":"5372","authorid":"picewolf",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=53642&ptid=5505xf任务确实有问题，最简单的推演就是战胜任务。ask xx about 投降，这个如果杀手第一次不投降，是需要你不断heal的。如果没有天龙米的话，确实不好弄。最后结果就是杀手强用内功死了。。。任务太难搞了就[2;37;0m","time":1237779240,"fid":"46","title":"jason，关于内伤的问题","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(picewolf)[2;37;0m","tid":"5505","authorid":"picewolf",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=53658&ptid=5505给他吃药[2;37;0m","time":1237784640,"fid":"46","title":"Re:jason，关于内伤的问题","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(jason)[2;37;0m","tid":"5505","authorid":"jason",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=53667&ptid=5505有能治内伤的药了么？现在[2;37;0m","time":1237785240,"fid":"46","title":"Re:jason，关于内伤的问题","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(picewolf)[2;37;0m","tid":"5505","authorid":"picewolf",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=53668&ptid=5505oh，我明白了。。呵呵[2;37;0m","time":1237785251,"fid":"46","title":"Re:jason，关于内伤的问题","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(picewolf)[2;37;0m","tid":"5505","authorid":"picewolf",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=53683&ptid=5060那就来做wiz吧，lol[2;37;0m","time":1237788240,"fid":"38","title":"Re:LPC 程式基本能力测验及答案（转载）","author":"巫师园地版(picewolf)[2;37;0m","tid":"5060","authorid":"picewolf",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=53685&ptid=5060[quote]原帖由 [i]picewolf[/i] 于 2009-3-23 01:55 PM 发表 [url=http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=53683&ptid=5060][img]http://pkuxkx.net/forum/ima