============================================================================[2;37;0m","time":1245510354,"fid":"46","title":"烹饪系统目前完成度","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(vast)[2;37;0m","tid":"6851","authorid":"vast",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=66339&ptid=6851vast总是做一些很系统的东西，强悍！ttk_00[2;37;0m","time":1245510403,"fid":"46","title":"Re:烹饪系统目前完成度","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(icer)[2;37;0m","tid":"6851","authorid":"icer",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=66357&ptid=6851牛X jasttk_41[2;37;0m","time":1245527155,"fid":"46","title":"Re:烹饪系统目前完成度","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(becool)[2;37;0m","tid":"6851","authorid":"becool",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=66361&ptid=6850[quote]原帖由 [i]picewolf[/i] 于 2009-6-20 08:24 PM 发表 [url=http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=66328&ptid=6850][img]http://pkuxkx.net/forum/images/common/back.gif[/img][/url]BUYONGZHAOJIMANMANZUOSHENTIYAOJINGONGZUOYEYAOJINWANANTAERQIGONGCHENGMANMANLAIWOKANHAONIO [/quote]fat用的是英语,你用的是拼音.fat有标点,你的啥也没有fat是输入中文有问题,不是显示中文有问题最后,我一口气看下来,差点没喘上气来[2;37;0m","time":1245537955,"fid":"46","title":"Re:To picewolf","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(safeguard)[2;37;0m","tid":"6850","authorid":"safeguard",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=66383&ptid=6850[quote]原帖由 [i]safeguard[/i] 于 2009-6-21 06:37 AM 发表 [url=http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=66361&ptid=6850][img]http://pkuxkx.net/forum/images/common/back.gif[/img][/url]fat用的是英语,你用的是拼音.fat有标点,你的啥也没有fat是输入中文有问题,不是显示中文有问题最后,我一口气看下来,差点没喘上气来 [/quote]语言造诣问题。。[2;37;0m","time":1245551756,"fid":"46","title":"Re:To picewolf","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(picewolf)[2;37;0m","tid":"6850","authorid":"picewolf",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=66390&ptid=6850Just resign, not job-hopping, that means I will lose my job without a new one. I\\'m not in one line of the th