这样，大家想铸造武器，第一可以自己练一个锻造师，第二可以找其它牛逼锻造师交易。基本的就这些东西，其实锻造职业设定早就提出要做了，现在是觉得不做不行了。大家有什么意见说说看？[2;37;0m","time":1265419614,"fid":"46","title":"换掉宝石镶嵌","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(becool)[2;37;0m","tid":"11601","authorid":"becool",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=123890&ptid=11601完全支持。不仅符合武侠特色，而且增加职业。建议把鉴定的问题一并解决了。[2;37;0m","time":1265434614,"fid":"46","title":"Re:换掉宝石镶嵌","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(jason)[2;37;0m","tid":"11601","authorid":"jason",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=123910&ptid=11601相当支持！[2;37;0m","time":1265444814,"fid":"46","title":"Re:换掉宝石镶嵌","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(icer)[2;37;0m","tid":"11601","authorid":"icer",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=123916&ptid=11457今天趁着重启更换了新编译的driver，cache增加了原来的driver备份在原目录下driver.20100206再观察一下[2;37;0m","time":1265446630,"fid":"46","title":"Re:cpu 100%时mud的status detail","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(icer)[2;37;0m","tid":"11457","authorid":"icer",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=123982&ptid=11457good, cache size:            4096slots used:            4096[2;37;0m","time":1265508430,"fid":"46","title":"Re:cpu 100%时mud的status detail","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(jason)[2;37;0m","tid":"11457","authorid":"jason",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=124034&ptid=11601[quote]原帖由 [i]jason[/i] 于 2010-2-6 01:34 PM 发表 [url=http://www.pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=123890&ptid=11601][img]http://www.pkuxkx.net/forum/images/common/back.gif[/img][/url]完全支持。不仅符合武侠特色，而且增加职业。建议把鉴定的问题一并解决了。 [/quote]鉴定是啥问题？[2;37;0m","time":1265556430,"fid":"46","title":"Re:换掉宝石镶嵌","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(becool)[2;37;0m","tid":"11601","authorid":"becool",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=124718&ptid=11457再次cpu 100%没心跳重启前的statusOpen-file-test succeeded.current stack 135057440/135847864current working directory