里么，嘉兴南湖一个区域加进去侍X和欧冶子全部放在一起罢了，都在沙漠绿洲，算第二个区域兵器就还是现在这样，只是兵器look时可以看出来是用什么材料锻冶出来的，之后要加入新的东西就容易了现有的自定义兵器可以弄补天石材料去重铸，加入材料信息，攻击没封顶的可以加5攻击这样就ok了吧[2;37;0m","time":1272176980,"fid":"46","title":"Re:ddid or becool","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(zgbl)[2;37;0m","tid":"13257","authorid":"zgbl",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=144635&ptid=13260编辑掉[2;37;0m","time":1272183580,"fid":"38","title":"Re:mud之我见（1）","author":"巫师园地版(zgbl)[2;37;0m","tid":"13260","authorid":"zgbl",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=144697&ptid=13063[quote]北大侠客行已经执行了二天七分二十六秒。[/quote][quote]Sentences:                        247931  4958620Objects:                           27584  6700512Prog blocks:                        5295  9763176Mappings:                         107021 21366588Mappings(nodes):                  716783Interactives:                        218  1383864Obj table overhead:                40028  2416380All strings:                     157626  5279632 + 1019868 overheadcall out:                           2540    60960 (current length 943)                                         --------Total:                                   52949962[/quote][quote]Open-file-test succeeded.current stack 135048200/135847864current working directory: /usr/local/mud/xkx/pkuxkxadd_message statistics------------------------------Calls to add_message: 167587890   Packets: 52026358   Average packet size: -2.250916Hash table of living objects:-----------------------------3651 living named objects, average search length: 6.72Function cache information-------------------------------% cache hits:         94.55call_others:     3122354345cache hits:      2952175659cache size:            4096slots used:            4096% slots used:        100.00collisions:       170174590% collisions:          5.45Swap information:-------------------------Progs swapped:           