000/factor < me->query(\\\"combat_exp\\\"))exp=2140000000;elseexp = factor*me->query(\\\"combat_exp\\\");skill=pow(exp/100.0,1.0/3)*10;family_skill(this_object(), \\\"shenlongjiao\\\", skill, 1);set(\\\"chat_chance_combat\\\", 10+this_object()->query(\\\"hyd/step\\\")*5);}else[/code][2;37;0m","time":1275579260,"fid":"46","title":"Re:白菜大神工作讨论帖","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(safeguard)[2;37;0m","tid":"14029","authorid":"safeguard",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=156601&ptid=14064今天小希满200岁，正好看到了/d/wizard下面的一堆乱七八糟的东西，就clone了个布娃娃给她小希玩得很开心，只可惜玩了就value 0，不能保存了。后来给她的布娃娃call了value，让她存了。挺好玩的东西，为什么要设置成一玩就不能保存呢？防止泛滥？[2;37;0m","time":1275584060,"fid":"46","title":"送了小希一个布娃娃","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(safeguard)[2;37;0m","tid":"14064","authorid":"safeguard",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=156602&ptid=14029如果要这样修改，就得同时修改rewardd，限制600m后所有任务单次奖励的上限到一个确定的数值，这样将随着经验增长升级速度越来越快改为线性匀速增长，才能大幅度延后再次溢出的时间，甚至可以考虑再设一个其他瓶颈，比如灵性或者其他什么属性或者任务，只有让这个属性增长，才能保持升级速度的线性，否则会越来越慢。[2;37;0m","time":1275590060,"fid":"46","title":"Re:白菜大神工作讨论帖","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(icer)[2;37;0m","tid":"14029","authorid":"icer",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=156604&ptid=14013unbuntu 10.04 编译无法通过。错误代码如下：./build.Mudos:159 gmake:not foundmake: Warning:file \\'Dependencies\\' has modification time 2.6e+08 s in the futuremake: Nothing to be done fro \\'nothing\\'.make:warning:clock shew detected. Your build mey be incomplete../build.Mudos:170:xlc:not foundinstall:invalid option--\\'f\\'Try \\'install--help\\' from more information.rm:cannot remove \\'tmp/insttest\\'  no such file or directory./build.MudOS:306 bison:not found./build.mudos:3222 byacc:not found./build.MudOS:322 yacc:not foundfatal ERROR: could not find bison or yacc.[2;37;0m","time":1275593060,"fid":"38","title":"Re:关于MudOSv22pre11 For Linux","author":"巫师园地版(chans)[2;37;0m","tid":"14013","authorid":