query_dynamic_desc()对应protected string *dynamicDesc=({});只要在头房间中实现了对应的变量则在更新地图的时候会自动根据变量值随机更新所有动态房间的描述。其中实现query_dynamic_full_desc()的优先级比query_dynamic_desc()更高，系统会优先选择使用query_dynamic_full_desc()的返回结果。最后讲一下动态地图更新函数：nomask void init_dynMap(string dir,object dynHead)这个函数输入参数是动态地图所在目录和动态地图头房间对象就会自动完成动态地图更新。[2;37;0m","time":1285571145,"fid":"38","title":"动态地图接口-jason进来看","author":"巫师园地版(seagate)[2;37;0m","tid":"16184","authorid":"seagate",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=187555&ptid=16184普通动态房间例子[2;37;0m","time":1285571199,"fid":"38","title":"Re:动态地图接口-jason进来看","author":"巫师园地版(seagate)[2;37;0m","tid":"16184","authorid":"seagate",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=187556&ptid=16184头房间例子[2;37;0m","time":1285571210,"fid":"38","title":"Re:动态地图接口-jason进来看","author":"巫师园地版(seagate)[2;37;0m","tid":"16184","authorid":"seagate",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=187558&ptid=16184动态地图才是防全自动的大杀器啊[2;37;0m","time":1285572346,"fid":"38","title":"Re:动态地图接口-jason进来看","author":"巫师园地版(sbear)[2;37;0m","tid":"16184","authorid":"sbear",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=187560&ptid=16184seagate的程序看着舒服，基本全加了注释：）加油啊[2;37;0m","time":1285574146,"fid":"38","title":"Re:动态地图接口-jason进来看","author":"巫师园地版(zine)[2;37;0m","tid":"16184","authorid":"zine",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=187635&ptid=16184yct10[2;37;0m","time":1285584946,"fid":"38","title":"Re:动态地图接口-jason进来看","author":"巫师园地版(dinglf)[2;37;0m","tid":"16184","authorid":"dinglf",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=187683&ptid=16196听说你给玩家换指定的特技，有这事儿么？还是那帮猪头忽悠我？[2;37;0m","time":1285595746,"fid":"46","title":"白菜，关于换特技","author":"北侠巫师讨论区(becool)[2;37;0m","tid":"16196","authorid":"becool",]),(["msg":"本帖地址：http://pkuxkx.net/forum/redirect.php?goto=findpost&pid=187693&ptid